      "text": "J101\nThis jumper determines the high-order address bit for Fat\n32\n1\nAgnus. In its normal position shown the high-order bit is\n~~\nA23; in its other position, this bit is A19. The current Fat\n|\nAgnus chip requires the A23 signal for proper manage-\nment of the memory at $COO000. Future Fat Agnus chips\n=\nmay map things differently.\n",
